; Room 46 ($2E): Tree Root
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: moves Willy left, 13 cells from row 10 column 0.
; Ramp: 6 cells from row 14 column 24 up to row 9 column 29, rising to the
; right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 2, at row 3 column 10; row 4 column
; 29.
; .
; Exits: left Room 45 (Under the Drive, #R$ED00); right Room 47 (the room
; titled "[", #R$EF00); up Room 3 (At the Foot of the MegaTree, #R$C300); down
; Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000). Odd: the down exit of Room 3 is Room 0,
; not this room; the right edge of the layout is walled in (no free cell next
; to it), so the right exit (byte 47) cannot be used by walking (inferred from
; the layout).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $1E (at $A0F0) start $84; slot 1: definition
; $28 (at $A140) start $0D; slot 2: definition $23 (at $A118) start $13; slot
; 3: definition $1F (at $A0F8) start $59. List ends at slot 4 ($FF).
@label=RoomTreeRoot
b$EE00 DEFB $AA,$0A,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA ; row 0: ####..##########################
 $EE08 DEFB $AA,$0A,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA,$AA ; row 1: ####..##########################
